case         CNSDFG ATRBYT   ref | zb
DIFF boot           255 15 | 0 15       
DIFF cls            255 15 | 0 15       CLS
SAME keyoff           0 15 | 0 15       KEY OFF
SAME keyoff_cls       0 15 | 0 15       KEY OFF:CLS
SAME keyon          255 15 | 255 15     KEY OFF:KEY ON
DIFF color5          255 5 | 0 15       COLOR 5
DIFF color5_1_4      255 5 | 0 15       COLOR 5,1,4
DIFF color_bg       255 15 | 0 15       COLOR ,1
DIFF sc2_color       255 9 | 0 15       SCREEN 2:COLOR 9:SCREEN 0

DIFF: 6/9
refcache: 0 hit, 2 miss, 2 stored
